  "type": "say",
  "speaker": "你",
  "actor": null,
  "text": "你是因为喜欢它的味道才买的？",
  "scene": "class",
  "seg": 6,
  "next": "a3-10"
 },
 {
  "id": "a3-10",
  "type": "say",
  "speaker": "苏桃",
  "actor": "sutao",
  "text": "嗯，桃子味，我挺喜欢。",
  "scene": "class",
  "seg": 6,
  "next": "a3-11"
 },
 {
  "id": "a3-11",
  "type": "say",
  "speaker": "你",
  "actor": null,
  "text": "那把它按实际类别记成饮料。奶类再另外安排。",
  "scene": "class",
  "seg": 6,
  "next": "a3-12"
 },
 {
  "id": "a3-12",
  "type": "say",
  "speaker": "你",
  "actor": null,
  "text": "群里说是下午碰面，三点半。",
  "scene": "class",
  "seg": 6,
  "next": "a3-13"
 },
 {
  "id": "a3-13",
  "type": "say",
  "speaker": "陆燃",
  "actor": "luran",
  "text": "我提前到。这次我不说几分钟了。",
  "scene": "class",
  "seg": 6,
  "next": "a3-14"
 },
 {
  "id": "a3-14",
  "type": "say",
  "speaker": "你",
  "actor": null,
  "text": "今天早餐安排得怎么样？",
  "scene": "class",
  "seg": 7,
  "next": "a3-15"
 },
 {
  "id": "a3-15",
  "type": "say",
  "speaker": "米粒",
  "actor": "mili",
  "text": "吃上了。这次照片里有完整的食物。我直接去便利店拿昨天选好的，没站在货架前想半天。昨晚把能按包装要求常温保存的东西准备好了，早上拿起来就走。今天食堂排队不长。星期三赶课那天，我就用备用方案。",
  "scene": "class",
  "seg": 7,
  "next": "a3-16"
 },
 {
  "id": "a3-16",
  "type": "say",
  "speaker": "你",
  "actor": null,
  "text": "来得及吃吗？份量感觉怎么样？",
  "scene": "class",
  "seg": 7,
  "next": "a3-17"
 },
 {
  "id": "a3-17",
  "type": "say",
  "speaker": "米粒",
  "actor": "mili",
  "text": "来得及。先这样试几天，有不合适的再改。",
  "scene": "class",
  "seg": 7,
  "next": "a3-18"
 },
 {
  "id": "a3-18",
  "type": "say",
  "speaker": "许知夏",
  "actor": "zhixia",
  "text": "好，记下实际情况就行。",
  "scene": "class",
  "seg": 7,
  "next": "a3-19"
 },
 {
  "id": "a3-19",
  "type": "say",
  "speaker": "米粒",
  "actor": "mili",
  "text": "酸奶我下午再看看，已经记在便签上了。",
  "scene": "class",
  "seg": 7,
  "next": "a3-20"
 },
 {
  "id": "a3-20",
  "type": "say",
  "speaker": "你",
  "actor": null,
  "text": "今天准备怎么点餐？",
  "scene": "class",
  "seg": 7,
  "next": "a3-21"
 },
 {
  "id": "a3-21",
  "type": "say",
  "speaker": "苏桃",
  "actor": "sutao",
  "text": "镜头终于拍到了盘子边缘。",
  "scene": "class",
  "seg": 7,
  "next": "a3-22"
 },
 {
  "id": "a3-22",
  "type": "say",
  "speaker": "陆燃",
  "actor": "luran",
